{"id":"b6318833c3cb4f67","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-dependent-function-per.md","title":"依赖函数空间的成员PER候选","display":"df-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数空间的成员PER候选","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-dependent-function-per","aliases":["72-df-dependent-function-per"],"display":"df-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数空间的成员PER候选","depends_on":["[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.9 dependent function construction, print746/PDF758; explicit abstract closed-term presentation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-dependent-function-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-dependent-function-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数空间的成员PER候选"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.9 dependent function construction, print746/PDF758; explicit abstract closed-term presentation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lam}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathsf{Lam}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ (v\\Downarrow v)\">\\(\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ (v\\Downarrow v)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T\\)</span> 是给定闭应用项构造。它们是结构参数，不是待证明存在的函数值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,a&#39;\\in|\\alpha|\\ (a\\alpha a&#39;\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a&#39;))\">\\(\\forall a,a&#39;\\in|\\alpha|\\ (a\\alpha a&#39;\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a&#39;))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\">\\(Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\">\\(\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\)</span> 在下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^\\Downarrow\">\\(R^\\Downarrow\\)</span> 为已有预求值扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}:=\\{\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Lam}^2:\n\\forall a,a&#39;\\in|\\alpha|\\ (a\\alpha a&#39;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\langle\\operatorname{app}(v,a),\\operatorname{app}(w,a&#39;)\\rangle\\in\\Phi(a))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}:=\\{\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Lam}^2:\n\\forall a,a&#39;\\in|\\alpha|\\ (a\\alpha a&#39;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\langle\\operatorname{app}(v,a),\\operatorname{app}(w,a&#39;)\\rangle\\in\\Phi(a))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi):=(Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi})^\\Downarrow.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi):=(Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi})^\\Downarrow.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书先在规范λ值之间比较所有相等参数上的结果，再作预求值扩张；这里用显式闭项应用构造抽象表达其体代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lam}\">\\(\\mathsf{Lam}\\)</span>、app与求值都保留为结构参数，不声称已经给出全部Nuprl操作语义。纤维关系在α等价类上相同是数学上必要的相容条件；只给每个输入一个任意PER不足以得到该依赖空间的对称性。空输入类型允许，条件此时真空成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 取 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]。固定 $\\mathsf{Lam}\\subseteq T$，且 $\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ (v\\Downarrow v)$；$\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T$ 是给定闭应用项构造。它们是结构参数，不是待证明存在的函数值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lam}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall v\\in\\mathsf{Lam}\\ (v\\Downarrow v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,a'\\in|\\alpha|\\ (a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a'))","display":false},{"tex":"Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"R^\\Downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}:=\\{\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Lam}^2:\n\\forall a,a'\\in|\\alpha|\\ (a\\alpha a'\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\langle\\operatorname{app}(v,a),\\operatorname{app}(w,a')\\rangle\\in\\Phi(a))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi):=(Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi})^\\Downarrow.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lam}","display":false}],"bytes":2229,"backlinks":[{"id":"53f8ac731ffeb567","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T:=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}$，$\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$；$\\mathsf{Lam}:=T$，$\\operatorname{app}:T^2\\to T$ 为恒1函数。α、β 及 Φ 由下式给出，Π 使用 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]] 的抽象接口。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-470","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-dependent-function-per|df-dependent-function-per — 依赖函数空间的成员PER候选]]"},{"id":"c122cb00ad69a4f6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app},\\alpha,\\Phi,Q^\\Pi_{\\alpha,\\Phi}$ 满足 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]] 的全部条件，特别是纤维在α类上相等。"},{"id":"c5b3799b1501dcab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P:=\\Pi_{\\mathfrak e,\\mathsf{Lam},\\operatorname{app}}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$ 及其结构与不变纤维取 [[72-df-dependent-function-per]]，其 PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-function-per]]。"}],"outgoing":["d79ea25f75d5218c"]}